# The recovered raw per-run records (E2/E3/E9) are evidence but are "raw records"
# in the repository's own sense: summaries and derived tables are committed, the
# per-run JSON is not. They stay on disk, reachable by the audit scripts, and out
# of Git.
ev/
*.tgz
# Verification backups of the GPU box: the archived copies are ~14 MB of binaries,
# so only their manifests are committed (HEAD, protocol digests, record counts,
# tables digests). The archives themselves stay on disk on both sides.
full-verify-*/
*.tar.gz
*.bundle
